Reading: U = O(M/n) -> 0 as n/M -> infinity at fixed d (once every atom is seen),
so at fixed d the learner is consistent on D_d at every width; the Omega(1) excess of
Theorem 4.4 lives only in the window n = Theta(2^d), i.e. it needs d -> infinity.
